{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ca9079a7-e9e6-85a4-b78b-f015dca3683f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T13:29:22-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniela Figueroa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:24:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:24:44-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Daniela Figueroa. I am calling because I would like to hold a yard sale, and I want to know if I must register it with the city."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:24:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a yard sale. Yes, let me, um, let me make sure I give you the right answer. Is this at your own home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:25:11-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, at my home. I rent the apartment, at 97 Ayrault Street, in the Historic Hill area. The landlord has no problem with it. I asked him already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:25:24-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that's helpful. So generally, yes, a yard sale does need to be registered here, a short registration with our office. It's not a big process."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:25:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That is good. Can I ask what I should bring with me in person? What documents?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:25:46-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Bring a photo ID, and something that shows your address, like a lease or a recent piece of mail. And since you're renting, it helps to have the landlord's okay, even just a note."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:26:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A note from landlord. Yes, I can do this. Should it be written, or is text message enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:26:12-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Written is better. A signed note, or you could print out an email from him. Either one is fine, I think. Let me double check that with the registration form. Can you hold for a moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:26:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course. I will wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:26:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for holding. Yes, a signed note or a printed email both work. Also, you'll put down the date or dates of the sale and the hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:26:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Dates, yes. I want to do it one Saturday, maybe in spring. Is there a limit how many days I can have?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:26:57-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is usually a limit on the number of sales per year at one address, and on how many days each one runs. I don't have the exact numbers in front of me. The person at the counter will go over it with you when you come in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:27:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. And what are the office hours? I am working from home, so I can come during the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:27:29-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're open weekdays, during regular business hours, at City Hall. Since it's the holiday week, I'd suggest coming in on a day other than Wednesday or Thursday to be safe, or calling first. Hours could be shorter around New Year's."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:27:48-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, this is good to know. Sorry, one moment. [pause] I am calling from the garden shed behind the house. It is my office, so sometimes the signal is not so good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:28:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. You're coming through fine. Can I get a phone number, in case we need to reach you before you come in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:28:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0170."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:28:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-oh. Got it. And that's Daniela Figueroa, F-I-G-U-E-R-O-A?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:28:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Very good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:28:27-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So to recap: photo ID, proof of address, and a signed note from your landlord. You'll fill out the yard sale registration at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:28:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And I do not need to bring any money? Or I do not know. Is there fee?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:28:48-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm not certain about that, to be honest. I'd rather not tell you wrong. The counter staff can tell you when you come in, and if you want, I can have someone call you back on that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:29:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it is fine. I will ask when I come. Thank you for your help, Mr. Owen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:29:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Figueroa. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T13:29:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
